{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And they will hearken to your voice</b> — meaning you need not raise your voice much, for they will immediately hearken to you. ושמעו — two times in the Masorah: ושמעו לקלך, and ושמעו מצרים כי העלית בכחך — when Moses spoke with Pharaoh, all Egypt heard. Another interpretation: even though his voice was low, it was heard throughout all the land of Egypt; and because a human voice is low, therefore it is defective."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:11:47.177354459Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}